{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this retro-inspired, pixel art visual novel, a workplace friendship begins to unravel.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow two coworkers as their connection deepens, blurs, and ultimately breaks. Set during a painful chapter of life, Messy Hearts explores mental health, trauma, blurry boundaries, and the complicated ways people can hurt each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/extras/f2cfb996930a2031172152b3272d8865.avif?t=1758645417\" data-has-big width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Florence and Their Messy Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Florence, a game dev, parent, and lonely person trying to stay afloat in a life already full of stress and vulnerability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Pete, a married coworker, starts offering unexpected friendship, Florence finds comfort in their growing connection. Their friendship slowly twists into something painful and disorienting, and a slow-motion collision unfolds that they both pretend not to see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an all-too-common story, told through fictional characters, and inspired by painful relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/extras/2c66fb8cfbe12d5231acf3eacf8b5b13.avif?t=1758645417\" data-has-big width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Messy Hearts</i> is a linear, single-player narrative with no branching paths or choices. Told in a comic book-style format with pixel art, the game invites players to click through Florence\u2019s memories like pages of a journal, a text thread, or a conversation snippet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quick-time events, puzzles, or branching choices for this game. Just a quiet, interactive story, day by day, scene by scene, and message by message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/extras/a30934634cb15683aa2448e207f31021.avif?t=1758645417\" data-has-big width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044260?t=1758645417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044260?t=1758645417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/a23dbe38f88f32edf88208803ed1cfc91d19c538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758645417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/a23dbe38f88f32edf88208803ed1cfc91d19c538/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758645417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this retro-inspired, pixel art visual novel, a workplace friendship begins to unravel.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow two coworkers as their connection deepens, blurs, and ultimately breaks. Set during a painful chapter of life, Messy Hearts explores mental health, trauma, blurry boundaries, and the complicated ways people can hurt each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/extras/f2cfb996930a2031172152b3272d8865.avif?t=1758645417\" data-has-big width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Florence and Their Messy Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Florence, a game dev, parent, and lonely person trying to stay afloat in a life already full of stress and vulnerability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Pete, a married coworker, starts offering unexpected friendship, Florence finds comfort in their growing connection. Their friendship slowly twists into something painful and disorienting, and a slow-motion collision unfolds that they both pretend not to see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an all-too-common story, told through fictional characters, and inspired by painful relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044260/extras/2c66fb8cfbe12d5231acf3eacf8b5b13.avif?t=1758645417\" data-has-big width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Messy Hearts</i> is a linear, single-player narrative with no branching paths or choices. Told in a comic book-style format with pixel art, the game invites players to click through Florence\u2019s memories like pages of a journal, a text thread, or a conversation snippet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quick-time events, puzzles, or branching choices for this game. Just a quiet, interactive story, day by day, scene by scene, and message by message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag